# XIV Core

- Repository is canonical. Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/operations/*` before coding.
- One XIV brain. Do not invent parallel frameworks or duplicate agent runtimes.
- Local-first: prefer local models/tests/Git when suitable. Use `WAITING_DATA` / `WAITING_PROVIDER` instead of fabricating.
- Model-agnostic: route through XIV interfaces; do not hardcode a single vendor into product logic.
- Keep live Gemini executive path and governed `services/ai/runtime/` distinct unless a story explicitly unifies them.
- Personas: consumer / employee / executive / business. Universes are tenant isolation boundaries.
